Package: cbcGWAS
Type: Package
Title: Liability-Scale Conversion for Covariate-Adjusted GWAS
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Siyi", "Chen", email = "sche11@lsuhsc.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes marginal, conditional-prevalence, and working-logistic
    conversion factors for covariate-adjusted binary genome-wide association
    studies (GWAS). Provides population and case-control calculations under a
    Gaussian liability model, calibration helpers, interfaces to published
    collider-bias estimators, and reproducible simulations for liability-scale
    genetic associations and Mendelian randomization. The conversion is local
    in small genetic effects and requires the model and identification
    assumptions described in the function documentation.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, parallel, statmod, mvtnorm
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), indexevent, SlopeHunter, mr.raps
Remotes: DudbridgeLab/indexevent, Osmahmoud/SlopeHunter
